    "custom_liquid_C3qEAq": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:names.custom_liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div id=\"toggleBtnTop\" onclick=\"toggleFaq()\" style=\"color: #e0e0e0; cursor: pointer; background: transparent; border: none; font-size: 13px; padding: 5px 0; display: inline-block; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.5px; user-select: none;\">\n  Know More\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"faqs\" style=\"padding:15px 0; display:none; background: transparent; border:none;\">\n\n  <style>\n    /* 统一控制文章内的标题与正文比例 */\n    #faqs h1 {\n      font-size: 1.5rem !important;\n      margin-top: 1rem !important;\n      margin-bottom: 1rem !important;\n      line-height: 1.2 !important;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #333;\n    }\n    #faqs h2 {\n      font-size: 1.25rem !important;\n      margin-top: 1.5rem !important;\n      margin-bottom: 0.75rem !important;\n      line-height: 1.3 !important;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: #333;\n    }\n    #faqs h3 {\n      font-size: 1.1rem !important;\n      margin-top: 1.2rem !important;\n      margin-bottom: 0.5rem !important;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: #444;\n    }\n    #faqs p, #faqs li {\n      font-size: 1rem !important;\n      line-height: 1.6 !important;\n      margin-bottom: 1rem !important;\n      color: #555;\n    }\n    #faqs table td {\n      padding: 12px 10px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\n      font-size: 0.95rem;\n    }\n    .horizontal-scroll-wrapper {\n      overflow-x: auto;\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\n      border: 1px solid #eee;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n    }\n    #faqs table {\n      width: 100%;\n      min-width: 500px; /* 保证对比表在手机上有足够的宽度滑动 */\n      border-collapse: collapse;\n    }\n    #faqs thead tr {\n      background-color: #f9f9f9;\n      text-align: left;\n    }\n  </style>\n\n  <h1 data-path-to-node=\"3\">The Ultimate Guide to Smart Thermostats: Modern Climate Control</h1>\n  <p data-path-to-node=\"4\">Upgrade your home’s efficiency with a <b data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"38\"><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/collections/smart-thermostat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">smart thermostat</a></b>. Whether you are looking for a sleek alternative to mainstream brands or need a specific solution for underfloor heating, our collection combines advanced technology with intuitive design.</p>\n\n  <h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\">1. Why Switch to a Smart Thermostat?</h2>\n  <p data-path-to-node=\"6\">A smart thermostat does more than just display the temperature; it learns your habits and optimizes energy usage.</p>\n  <ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\n    <li><b>Remote Access:</b> Control your heating from anywhere using our <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/wifi-room-thermostat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WiFi Room Thermostat</a>.</li>\n    <li><b>Wireless Convenience:</b> Eliminate messy wiring with the <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/wifi-wireless-thermostat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WiFi Wireless Thermostat</a>.</li>\n    <li><b>Energy Savings:</b> Precise scheduling can reduce heating bills by up to 15%–20%.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2 data-path-to-node=\"9\">2. Specialized Solutions: 2-Wire &amp; Underfloor Heating</h2>\n  <p data-path-to-node=\"10\">According to recent UK search trends, homeowners often struggle with compatibility for older 2-wire systems or modern underfloor zones.</p>\n  <ul data-path-to-node=\"11\">\n    <li><b>The Best Nest Alternative:</b> If you are looking for a high-performance replacement for big brands, our <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/wifi-thermostat-an-alternative-to-nest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WiFi Thermostat (An Alternative to Nest)</a> is the perfect fit for standard UK boilers.</li>\n    <li><b>Multi-Zone Control:</b> Integrate your system with our <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/wiring-center-8-channel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">8-Channel Wiring Center</a>, ideal for managing multiple rooms or underfloor heating loops.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2 data-path-to-node=\"13\">3. Design Meets Technology</h2>\n  <p data-path-to-node=\"14\">Your thermostat shouldn't just be smart; it should look great on your wall.</p>\n  <ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\n    <li><b>Minimalist Aesthetics:</b> Our thermostats match our premium switch ranges, including the <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/dimmer-switch-white-steel-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">White Steel</a> and <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/dimmer-switch-solid-brass-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Solid Brass</a> collections.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2 data-path-to-node=\"17\">Smart Thermostat Comparison Table</h2>\n  <div class=\"horizontal-scroll-wrapper\">\n    <table data-path-to-node=\"18\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <td><strong>Feature</strong></td>\n          <td><strong>WiFi Room</strong></td>\n          <td><strong>WiFi Wireless</strong></td>\n          <td><strong>Nest Alternative</strong></td>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <td><b>Connectivity</b></td>\n          <td>2.4GHz WiFi</td>\n          <td>WiFi + RF</td>\n          <td>WiFi</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td><b>Power Supply</b></td>\n          <td>Hardwired</td>\n          <td>Battery/Mains</td>\n          <td>Hardwired</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td><b>App Control</b></td>\n          <td>Yes</td>\n          <td>Yes</td>\n          <td>Yes</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td><b>Best For</b></td>\n          <td>Standard Room</td>\n          <td>Flexible Placement</td>\n          <td>Full Smart Upgrade</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n\n  <h2 data-path-to-node=\"20\">FAQs</h2>\n  <h3 data-path-to-node=\"21\">Can I use a smart thermostat with a 2-wire system?</h3>\n  <p data-path-to-node=\"22\">Yes. Many of our models, including the <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/wifi-thermostat-an-alternative-to-nest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WiFi Thermostat</a>, are compatible with standard 2-wire or 230V systems found in UK homes.</p>\n\n  <h3 data-path-to-node=\"23\">Do I need a professional to install these?</h3>\n  <p data-path-to-node=\"24\">While designed for straightforward installation, we always recommend consulting a qualified electrician to ensure compatibility with your boiler or <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/wiring-center-8-channel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">8-channel wiring center</a>.</p>\n\n  <h3 data-path-to-node=\"25\">Does it work with underfloor heating?</h3>\n  <p data-path-to-node=\"26\">Absolutely. Our <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/wifi-wireless-thermostat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WiFi Wireless Thermostat</a> is a top choice for underfloor systems due to its precision sensors.</p>\n\n  <h2 data-path-to-node=\"28\" style=\"border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding-top: 20px;\">Complete Your Smart Home</h2>\n  <p data-path-to-node=\"29\">Pair your thermostat with our other premium collections:</p>\n  <ul data-path-to-node=\"30\">\n    <li><b><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/collections/dimmer-switch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Smart Dimmer Collection</a></b></li>\n    <li><b><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/collections/light-switch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Luxury Light Switches</a></b></li>\n    <li><b><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/collections/all-products\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Comprehensive Product Range</a></b></li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <div id=\"toggleBtnBottom\" onclick=\"toggleFaq()\" style=\"color: #e0e0e0; cursor: pointer; background: transparent; border: none; font-size: 13px; padding: 10px 0; display: inline-block; margin-top: 15px; font-weight: 300;\">\n    Show Less\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  function toggleFaq() {\n    const content = document.getElementById('faqs');\n    const topBtn = document.getElementById('toggleBtnTop');\n\n    if (content.style.display === \"none\") {\n      content.style.display = \"block\";\n      topBtn.style.display = \"none\";\n    } else {\n      content.style.display = \"none\";\n      topBtn.style.display = \"inline-block\";\n      window.scrollTo({ top: topBtn.offsetTop - 100, behavior: 'smooth' });\n    }\n  }\n</script>",
